{"type":"message","id":"6d6b6b2f","parentId":"aa628a30","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:52:11.341Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The schema lookup returned no children for `agents.defaults.model`. This might mean it's a free-form object. Let me look at the current value to understand the structure better.\n\nFrom the config I read earlier:\n```json\n\"defaults\": {\n    \"model\": {\n      \"primary\": \"coze/auto\"\n    },\n```\n\nSo `agents.defaults.model` is an object with a `primary` key. The patch should set `agents.defaults.model.primary` to the new model string.\n\nNow let me also think about whether I should add a custom command handler for `/aigit`. \n\nLooking at the OpenClaw docs, I don't see a `commands.custom` or `commands.slash` field. \n\nSince OpenClaw doesn't have built-in custom slash commands, I'll use the `/config` command that's already available to patch the model setting directly. The approach is to add the gitcode provider to `models.providers`, set it as primary in `agents.defaults.model.primary`, and then show VAN how to switch between models using `/config` commands.\n\nNow I'm adding the image input type to the Qwen3.5-397B model since VAN's curl example includes vision capabilities, even though the base64 image processing might need to be handled through the existing vision framework.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，明白了。我来给你配置：\n\n1. **添加 GitCode (Qwen3.5-397B) 为新 provider**\n2. **设为默认主力模型**\n3. **配置 `/aigit` 切换命令**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ba3qmfbx7tv0_1","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.patch","note":"已添加 GitCode Qwen3.5-397B provider 并设为主力模型，VAN 可用 /config 或 /model 切换。","raw":"{\n  \"models\": {\n    \"mode\": \"merge\",\n    \"providers\": {\n      \"gitcode\": {\n        \"baseUrl\": \"https://api-ai.gitcode.com/v1\",\n        \"apiKey\": \"VM5Bo25UzEvooA565Xy7iEyY\",\n        \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n        \"models\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"qwen3.5-397b-a17b\",\n            \"name\": \"Qwen3.5 397B\",\n            \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n            \"reasoning\": true,\n            \"input\": [\"text\", \"image\"],\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"input\": 0,\n              \"output\": 0,\n              \"cacheRead\": 0,\n              \"cacheWrite\": 0\n            },\n            \"contextWindow\": 131072,\n            \"maxTokens\": 8192,\n            \"extra\": {\n              \"supports\": {\n                \"vision\": true,\n                \"temperature\": true,\n                \"top_p\": true,\n                \"top_k\": true,\n                \"frequency_penalty\": true,\n                \"stream\": true\n              },\n              \"defaultParameters\": {\n                \"temperature\": 0.7,\n                \"top_p\": 0.7,\n                \"top_k\": 50,\n                \"frequency_penalty\": 0\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"defaults\": {\n      \"model\": {\n        \"primary\": \"gitcode/qwen3.5-397b-a17b\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":63,"output":993,"cacheRead":33595,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34651,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776253915968}}
