{"type":"message","id":"4ccba951","parentId":"8aad20b5","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:52:32.720Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The config was patched successfully and a restart was triggered. Now let me also create a custom skill for the `/aigit` command to handle model switching. Since OpenClaw doesn't have native custom slash commands, I should create a skill that can handle the switching.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The `/aigit` command is a text command that users type. In OpenClaw, text commands are handled through the chat interface. The user would type `/aigit` and the agent would respond.\n\nBut since the agent IS running on the GitCode model now, how would it handle the `/aigit` command switch? It would need to use the `session_status` tool to set the model... but that's for per-session overrides.\n\n\nI need to look at how OpenClaw actually supports slash commands. The built-in `/model` command already allows switching models, so I could potentially configure a custom command to call `gateway.config.patch` when triggered. Let me check if there's a way to register custom commands in the config.\n\nActually, I think the most practical approach is to create a skill that handles the model switching dynamically. I'd set up a skill with a trigger pattern like `/aigit` that, when invoked, would patch the gateway config to switch the model provider.\n\nThe challenge is that skills typically need the model to already be running to process the trigger. So the flow would be: user types `/aigit`, the current model handles it and triggers the config patch to switch to the Qwen model, then all subsequent messages use that new model. I should also add Coze as a fallback option in case the user wants to switch back, then finalize the skill with the model switching logic.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"配置已写入并触发重启 ✅。现在来创建 `/aigit` 切换技能，让它可以动态切换模型：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6f3yy8gd9nvu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":5424,"output":760,"cacheRead":32699,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38883,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776253937802}}
