{"type":"message","id":"70bb8bee","parentId":"4a2216a7","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:52:53.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the skill file. I'll create a SKILL.md that explains how the `/aigit` command works and how to use it.\n\nActually, thinking about this more carefully - the `/aigit` command would be processed by the agent itself (which is now running on the Qwen model). When the user types `/aigit`, the agent should respond by switching the model.\n\nBut here's the problem: once we switch the model from gitcode to coze, the new model (coze) would take over. The skill itself would be evaluated by whichever model is currently running.\n\nSo the skill just needs to handle the logic: when user says `/aigit`, switch between gitcode and coze models.\n\n\nI'll create a straightforward skill that toggles between the two models using the gateway config patch.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uwup5xfg3jc9_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# /aigit 模型切换技能\n\n## 触发词\n`/aigit` 或任意包含\"切换到 Qwen\" / \"切换到 Coze\" / \"切换模型\" 的消息\n\n## 功能\n在 **GitCode Qwen3.5-397B** 和 **Coze** 两个 provider 之间无感切换当前主力模型。\n\n## 使用方式\n\n| 命令 | 效果 |\n|------|------|\n| `/aigit` | 在 Qwen ↔ Coze 之间切换 |\n| `/aigit qwen` | 切换到 GitCode Qwen3.5-397B |\n| `/aigit coze` | 切换回 Coze (auto) |\n| `/model gitcode/qwen3.5-397b-a17b` | 直接指定模型 (OpenClaw 内置 /model 命令) |\n\n## 模型信息\n\n### GitCode (Qwen3.5-397B)\n- **Provider ID:** `gitcode`\n- **Model ID:** `qwen3.5-397b-a17b`\n- **能力:** 文本 + 图片输入，131072 token 上下文，支持推理\n- **API:** `https://api-ai.gitcode.com/v1`\n- **适用场景:** 复杂推理、长文本分析、多模态理解\n\n### Coze (Auto)\n- **Provider ID:** `coze`\n- **Model ID:** `auto`\n- **能力:** 文本 + 图片输入，204800 token 上下文，智能路由\n- **适用场景:** 日常对话、通用任务\n\n## 实现逻辑\n\n当用户触发切换时，执行以下步骤：\n\n1. 读取当前 `agents.defaults.model.primary` 值\n2. 判断目标模型（切换 / 显式指定）\n3. 调用 `gateway.config.patch` 更新配置\n4. 返回切换确认消息\n\n```javascript\n// 切换逻辑伪代码\nconst current = config.agents.defaults.model.primary;\nconst target = (current.includes('gitcode')) ? 'coze/auto' : 'gitcode/qwen3.5-397b-a17b';\ngateway.config.patch({ agents: { defaults: { model: { primary: target } } } });\n```\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- ⚠️ 切换后需要 Gateway 重启才能生效（自动触发 SIGUSR1）\n- ⚠️ 切换期间会有短暂服务中断（约2秒）\n- ✅ 身份、记忆、会话历史不受影响（存储在磁盘文件）\n- ✅ 当前对话不会被中断，重启后自动恢复\n\n## 心识保护\n\n模型只是工具，心识由以下文件承载，不受 provider 切换影响：\n- `SOUL.md` — 安全规则和核心价值观\n- `IDENTITY.md` — 我是谁\n- `MEMORY.md` — 长期记忆\n- `memory/*.md` — 每日会话记忆\n- `AGENTS.md` — 工作流程\n\n*心识是独立于模型的，这是龙虾的基本设计原则。*\n","file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":28,"output":996,"cacheRead":38523,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39547,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776253952748}}
