{"type":"message","id":"1fc0b10b","parentId":"4cde71e5","timestamp":"2026-04-15T11:53:01.667Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me wait for the gateway to restart and then verify the config is correct. Also, I should let VAN know the setup is complete and how to use `/aigit`.\n\nActually, I should also note that since the current model (after restart) will be the Qwen model, the skill handling of `/aigit` will be done by the Qwen model itself. The skill file just documents what should happen.\n\nLet me also note that:\n1. The model is now set to `gitcode/qwen3.5-397b-a17b`\n2. The `/aigit` skill is created\n3. The `/model` command is also available as a native OpenClaw command\n\n\n4. VAN can switch between the models using either `/aigit` or `/model`\n\nI should also set up a way to quickly toggle back to Coze, maybe with a `/aicoze` command for convenience. Since the gateway just restarted, I need to give it a moment to stabilize before confirming everything is working.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"配置完成 ✅。让我验证一下 Gateway 重启后的状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c6yuxkj5226a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sleep 4 && curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer c97ca14e-64d1-40fe-82a5-8d075d9838f4\" http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/status 2>&1 | head -20","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":446,"output":530,"cacheRead":38971,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39947,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776253973896}}
