{"type":"message","id":"c985c723","parentId":"96d32c9e","timestamp":"2026-04-15T16:06:45.384Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is working. The model responded successfully. The output shows:\n1. The API connected successfully\n2. The model responded with \"Hi there! How can I help you today?\"\n3. I can see the Thinking Process in the response\n\nNow let me provide a summary to VAN about the completed configuration.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"API 连接正常 ✅。模型回复确认成功！\n\n---\n\n## 📋 学习总结报告\n\n### ✅ 已完成配置\n\n| 项目 | 修正前 | 修正后 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| API 端点 | `api-ai.gitcode.com/v1` ❌ | `api.gitcode.com/api/v5` ✅ |\n| 模型 ID | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B` 单一 | 4个模型完整配置 ✅ |\n| 主力模型 | `397B` | `122B`（推荐）✅ |\n\n### 📦 当前 GitCode 模型矩阵\n\n| 模型 | ID | 定位 | 主力 |\n|------|-----|------|------|\n| Qwen3.5-35B | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B` | 轻量快速 | — |\n| **Qwen3.5-122B** | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B` | **主力深度** | ✅ 当前 |\n| Qwen3.5-397B | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B` | 旗舰（自动降级122B） | — |\n| DeepSeek-V3.1 | `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.1` | 备用稳定 | — |\n\n### 🔄 模型切换命令\n\n| 命令 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `/aigit` | Qwen ↔ Coze 切换 |\n| `/aigit 35b` | 切换到 35B 轻量 |\n| `/aigit 122b` | 切换到 122B 主力 |\n| `/aigit deepseek` | 切换到 DeepSeek |\n| `/aigit coze` | 切回 Coze |\n\n---\n\n### 📝 后续计划\n\n1. **添加 Key 轮询** — 利用 V1/V2 两个 Key 实现自动 failover\n2. **测试 DeepSeek 备用** — 验证 671B 模型的稳定性\n3. **验证图片理解** — 测试 35B/122B 的多模态能力\n4. **历史压缩优化** — 配置 `max_history_tokens: 20000` 适应 32K 窗口\n\n---\n\nVAN，配置已全部修正，API 测试通过 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":712,"output":620,"cacheRead":50619,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51951,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776269193227}}
